---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro"
import HeroImage from "../assets/hero-section.png"
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components"
---

<section class="px-6 py-12 items-center flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center text-sm gap-2 text-blue-700 ring-blue-950 ring-1 px-2 py-1 rounded-full">
      <span class="block w-3 h-3 bg-blue-700 rounded-full"></span>
      V2 Now Live
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-white">Poderosa API Rest para <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-blue-500">Desarrolladores Modernos</span></h1>

    <p>Integra nuestros robustos endpoints en minutos. Construcción rápida, seguridad end-to-end, y escala global. No más dolores de cabeza por infrastructura.</p>

    <div class="flex gap-6">
      <button class="bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold flex items-center px-8 py-5 rounded-lg gap-2">Comienza Gratis <Icon name="mdi:arrow-right" size={24} /></button>
      <button class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold flex items-center px-8 py-5 rounded-lg gap-2">Ver Documentación</button>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-5">
      <div class="flex gap-">
        <div class="w-6"><div class="ring-slate-950 ring-4 h-8 w-8 bg-neutral-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
        <div class="w-6"><div class="ring-slate-950 ring-4 h-8 w-8 bg-neutral-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
        <div class="w-6"><div class="ring-slate-950 ring-4 h-8 w-8 bg-neutral-400 rounded-full"></div></div>
      </div>

      <p>Más de <b>12</b> colaboradores</p>
    </div>


  </div>
  
  <div class="w-full max-w-3xl lg:max-w-xl">
    <Image
      src={HeroImage}
      alt={'Captura de código'}
      class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden w-full shadow-xl shadow-blue-600/10"
    />
  </div>
    
</section>